WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:06.279
2020 may have been a little lackluster when
it came to live-action comic book movies and

00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:10.240
shows, but fear not — next year looks more
than ready to make up for it.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:16.289
From the best of Marvel, DC, and beyond, here's
every live-action superhero movie and series

00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:18.080
coming in 2021.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:24.159
On January 15th, WandaVision is set to kick
off Marvel Studios' new era in television

00:00:24.159 --> 00:00:28.949
— and, judging from the trailers, it may
just be the weirdest Marvel project yet.

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:34.050
Naturally, Elizabeth Olsen and Paul Bettany
return as Wanda Maximoff and Vision.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:38.510
After the devastating events of Avengers:
Infinity War and Endgame, the two lovebirds

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:43.100
are finally living a peaceful, happy existence
in a perfect suburban town.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.390
Obviously, There's just one problem: Vision's
supposed to be dead — and the cracks soon

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:50.449
begin to appear in his new, perfect life with
Wanda.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:56.820
The miniseries looks to be a loose adaptation
of both Tom King's 2016 Vision series and

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.129
the "House of M" storyline, which could open
up a world of possibilities for both the movies

00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:02.290
and TV shows moving forward.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:07.710
The Arrowverse's own Superman has made a handful
of cameos and appearances over the years.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:12.030
And despite never being a main character,
Tyler Hoechlin's portrayal of Clark Superman

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:16.840
became an instant fan favorite — so now
The CW has finally decided to give him his

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.549
own spinoff series: Superman &amp; Lois.

00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:23.590
During this series, Lois and Clark return
to Smallville to take care of some Kent family

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:27.970
business, deal with the trials and tribulations
of superpowered parenting, and face a new

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:29.710
threat from a mysterious villain.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.360
In short: it's classic Superman with a thrilling
twist.

00:01:33.799 --> 00:01:37.770
Marvel fans have been clamoring for a proper
team-up between Bucky Barnes and Sam Wilson

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:41.110
ever since Captain America: Civil War first
hit theaters.

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:46.049
It looks like Marvel agreed, too, since The
Falcon and the Winter Soldier is due to hit

00:01:46.049 --> 00:01:47.930
Disney+ on March 19th.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:48.930
.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:52.159
The series will revolve around Bucky and Sam
teaming up together in the wake of Avengers:

00:01:52.159 --> 00:01:53.159
Endgame.

00:01:53.159 --> 00:01:57.340
Sam is struggling to feel worthy of Captain
America's shield, while Bucky is just hoping

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.740
his brainwashed head is back on straight.

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:04.020
Together, the two try to be everything to
the world that Captain America was — but

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:09.170
their lives are soon upended by the emergence
of an old enemy: Civil War's villain Helmut

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.170
Zemo.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:13.200
And yes, don't worry — there'll be plenty
of bickering along the way, too.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.480
"Oh yeah, I can see it working.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.540
Gears turning — oh, they're malfunctioning.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.840
They're on fire!"

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.570
"God, I hate you."

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:26.250
Morbius is the second Sony movie to be based
on a Spider-Man villain, after 2018's surprise

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.250
hit Venom.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:32.620
Jared Leto stars as Michael Morbius, a brilliant
but frail biochemist with a rare blood disorder.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:38.010
In a desperate attempt to cure himself, he
accidentally infects himself a form of vampirism,

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.600
turning him into Morbius, the Living Vampire.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.440
The trailer for Morbius makes it appear as
though Sony will be taking a more sympathetic

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:48.350
approach to telling Morbius' story, just like
they did with Venom.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:53.250
There's also something here for MCU fans,
since Morbius is set to feature Michael Keaton's

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.940
Vulture, who was last seen in 2017's Spider-Man:
Homecoming.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.340
Morbius is set for release on March 19th.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:05.590
Ever since the release of the much-maligned
Justice League back in 2017, a small but vocal

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:10.110
group of online fans have been petitioning
for the release of Zack Snyder's cut of the

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.110
movie.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.510
And in March 2021, it's finally happening.

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:17.680
Normally, Snyder would never have been given
tens of millions to recut a movie that already

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:22.670
underwhelmed fans and critics, but with the
COVID-19 pandemic killing the theater business

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:27.320
and Warner Bros. struggling to get HBO Max
off the ground, desperation has led them to

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.980
giving Snyder the green light.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:33.340
The new cut will reportedly be four hours
long, with alternate storylines and brand-new

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:37.870
footage being shot, including the appearance
of the iconic DC villain Darkseid.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:42.350
Of course, it remains to be seen whether or
not Warner Bros' gamble will pay off — but

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:45.590
either way, it'll be fascinating to see how
it all plays out.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:50.260
Natasha Romanoff has long been the glue that
has held the Avengers together.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:54.210
Fans have been hoping for a Black Widow movie
for quite some time, and despite the character

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:58.320
meeting her maker during the events of Endgame,
they're finally getting one.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:02.950
Black Widow is set between the events of Captain
America: Civil War and Avengers: Infinity

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:07.960
War, and finds Natasha travelling back to
her homeland of Russia to explore the mysteries

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.200
of the Red Room, in which she was trained
and brainwashed.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.200
Along the way, she reconnects with her first
found family, who come together to take down

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:19.610
a mysterious foe from the past: the Red Room's
new head honcho, Taskmaster.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.960
Originally due for release last May, Black
Widow promises a high-stakes spy thriller

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.230
with a golden heart.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:31.270
Although things may change, the movie is currently
set for a theatrical release on May 7th, 2021.

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.130
Just when you thought you'd seen the last
of him, Loki is back.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.130
"Surprise."

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:43.190
Debuting on Disney+ in May, Loki will follow
a pre-redemption, 2012 version of the character,

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:46.690
who steals the Tesseract following the events
of the Battle of New York.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:51.010
Unfortunately for everyone's favorite trickster
god, he soon lands in the custody of the Time

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:55.750
Variance Authority — a secret governing
body charged with policing the Marvel universe's

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.930
alternate timelines and realities.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:02.880
Obviously, the TVA aren't exactly keen on
the idea of an alternate timeline version

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:06.940
of the God of Mischief bouncing around with
a Tesseract, so it looks as though they strike

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.380
a deal with him, in a loose adaptation of
the Agent of Asgard comic book series.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:16.530
Loki has the ability to reset the MCU timeline
in an enormous way — or even forge a number

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:17.940
of brand-new ones.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:22.940
Created by Rick and Morty writer Michael Waldron,
you can safely expect plenty of time-travelling

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:26.870
nonsense, a bunch of alternate Lokis, and
a whole lot of chaotic fun.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:33.840
In 2018, Venom became an unexpected hit for
Sony, raking in a staggering $856 million

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.390
at the box office.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:39.710
Part of the reason the movie succeeded was
that it didn't take itself at all seriously,

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.460
instead leaning into that irresistible comic
book campness.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:46.700
Of course, Tom Hardy putting on a genuinely
manic performance didn't hurt, either.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:51.680
So naturally, on June 25th, Hardy is reprising
the role of Eddie Brock in Venom: Let There

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:52.680
Be Carnage.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:57.840
As dangerous as Venom can be, the sequel promises
to introduce another favorite Marvel character

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:02.500
that's even more deadly: Cletus Kasady, a
serial killer who becomes the horrific entity

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.930
known as Carnage.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:07.980
With Woody H arrelson joining the cast as
Kasady, Venom: Let There Be Carnage is sure

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.710
to be, if nothing else, a wild ride indeed.

00:06:11.805 --> 00:06:16.750
The first Phase 4 Marvel movie led by a brand-new
MCU hero, Shang-Chi and the Legend of the

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:22.390
Ten Rings promises to blend tons of martial
arts action with the zany mysticism of 2016's

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.780
Doctor Strange.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:28.560
Starring Simu Liu, Legend of the Ten Rings
finds Shang-Chi taking part in an epic tournament,

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.990
where the winner will be granted the legendary
Ten Rings, earning them immense amounts of

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.990
power.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.380
Early reports have indicated that the fight
sequences in the movie will be incredibly

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:42.520
dynamic, with everything from gritty, hand-to-hand
fighting to more mystical wuxia sequences

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:46.420
— that may even feature Shang-Chi's comic
book ability to create clones of himself.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:51.500
Liu has already won fans over with his hilarious
social media presence, so it'll be great to

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.030
see that natural charisma translate to Marvel's
latest hero.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:59.450
Throw in the legendary Hong Kong actor Tony
Leung as the Mandarin — and maybe a cameo

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:04.790
appearance or two — and you might just have
the recipe for 2021's biggest Marvel movie.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.950
We'll find out for sure on July 9th.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:13.000
The 2016 version of Suicide Squad was poorly
received, to say the least, despite introducing

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:17.190
a number of fan-favorite characters — including
Margot Robbie's Harley Quinn.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:21.770
Luckily, it seems the Warner Bros. are up
for giving the Squad another chance with James

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:25.960
Gunn's The Suicide Squad, which is set to
be release on August 6th.

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:30.590
The sequel will bring back Harley and a number
of OG members of the first movie's squad.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:35.810
However, in true James Gunn fashion, the movie
will also introduce well over a dozen new

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.790
superheroes, each weirder than the last.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.650
Gunn has promised that this is the craziest
and biggest movie he's ever done, and, well,

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.570
who are we to argue?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:49.910
Eternals is the second Marvel movie of 2021
to usher in a host of new characters to the

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:50.910
MCU.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.389
This time, however, it's a brand-new superhero
team.

00:07:53.389 --> 00:07:57.790
The Eternals are an ancient race of superhumans
who have been living in the shadows for thousands

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:58.790
of years.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.240
However, following the events of Avengers:
Endgame, an unexpected event forces the Eternals

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:07.850
back into the spotlight to take on their most
ancient enemies, the hideous Deviants.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:12.380
The cast of Eternals is absolutely stacked
to say the least, with Richard Madden playing

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:19.580
Ikaris Angelina Jolie as Thena , Gemma Chan
as Sersi, Salma Hayek as Ajak , Kumail Nanjiani

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:26.100
as Kingo, Barry Keoghan as Druig , Brian Tyree
Henry as Phastos , Lauren Ridloff as Makkari

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:32.039
, Lia McHugh as Sprite, Don Lee as Gilgamesh,
and Kit Harington as Dane Whitman, also known

00:08:32.039 --> 00:08:33.440
as the Black Knight.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:37.930
Not much is known about the movie's plot beyond
the premise and the cast, but it'll be fascinating

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.830
to see how critically-acclaimed director Chloe
Zhao guides this new team of heroes into the

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.830
MCU.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.120
Eternals is due for release on November 5th.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:51.490
After years developing the project, Dwayne
Johnson's Black Adam is finally hitting theaters

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.570
on December 22nd.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:57.340
Johnson has always been keen to bring the
story of Black Adam to life, as he'll be unlike

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.680
most characters yet seen in the DCEU.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.400
This is because Adam isn't so much a hero
as he is an antihero — at best — and the

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.550
looks to be leaning into the character's questionable
morals.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:11.890
Adam is a former slave who still carries with
him a zeal for justice.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:16.700
His powers are similar to Shazam's, but Adam's
ruthless streak gives him a much darker edge.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:21.061
For now, the movie is still on track, but
thanks to a number of pandemic delays, there's

00:09:21.061 --> 00:09:23.680
a chance this one could be bumped to 2022.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:29.110
After spending literally three decades in
development hell, a live-action adaptation

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:34.180
of Neil Gaiman's beloved and critically acclaimed
graphic novel series The Sandman will finally

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:37.550
see the light of day on Netflix, sometime
in 2021.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:42.520
The Sandman revolves around its main character,
Dream, who is also the eponymous "Sandman."

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:47.230
Dream is one of the seven Endless, ancient
beings who embody powerful concepts, including

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:51.770
Death, Despair, Delirium, Destruction, Destiny,
and Desire.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:56.210
They've existed since the dawn of time and
spend most of their time fulfilling the functions

00:09:56.210 --> 00:10:00.740
of their name — but, as you might guess,
their sibling relationships are a little dysfunctional.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.720
Much of The Sandman deals with Dream learning
that he can't control everything, and that

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.870
all things, even him, must deal with the sins
of his past.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:12.010
During its celebrated run, The Sandman was
the first graphic novel to win the World Fantasy

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:17.690
Award for Short Fiction and has won more than
two dozen Eisner Awards, the Bram Stoker Award,

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:18.770
and the Hugo Award.

00:10:19.779 --> 00:10:25.120
Kamala Khan first made her Marvel comics debut
in 2013, and fans have been dying to see a

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.900
live-action adaptation ever since.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:32.050
Newcomer Iman Vellani has been cast as Kamala
for the Disney+ series; the character is a

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:37.100
Pakistani-American Muslim teenager who lives
in New Jersey and is obsessed with superheroes

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.850
— including her favorite of all, Captain
Marvel.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:44.430
When Kamala is accidentally exposed to the
chemical Terrigen Mist, however, it activates

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:49.649
her dormant Inhuman cells, turning her into
a superhero with shapeshifting powers.

00:10:49.649 --> 00:10:54.100
Since 2013, Kamala has led the youth movement
in Marvel Comics, becoming one of the new

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:58.910
wave of teenage superheroes who are now coming
to the fore in Marvel's Disney+ shows.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:03.980
Ms. Marvel is set to debut sometime in late
2021, and it's already been confirmed that

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:07.520
Kamala will be making an appearance in future
movies, too.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:13.150
The last of 2021's Disney+ series, Hawkeye
will find Jeremy Renner reprising his role

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.460
of Clint Barton.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:18.540
This time, however, the master archer will
be joined by a young apprentice, Kate Bishop,

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:22.170
who, in the comics, takes over as the new
Hawkeye when Clint retires.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:29.380
"What I get to do in the show ultimately is
shepherd an amazing character to be ultimately

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:31.330
probably a better version of me."

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:35.303
Although there's bound to be plenty of action,
Hawkeye will likely be more of a character

00:11:35.303 --> 00:11:37.340
study than fans might have expected.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:41.399
In particular, it seems that the series will
be borrowing heavily from Matt Fraction's

00:11:41.399 --> 00:11:46.410
Hawkeye: My Life As a Weapon, which leaned
heavily into its absurdist, dark humor, as

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:51.130
well as the struggles of being a non-powered,
normal guy trying to keep up in a world of

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.130
superheroes.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:55.710
The MCU version of Hawkeye has always been
at his best when borrowing from the humor

00:11:55.710 --> 00:12:00.380
of Fraction's run, so a whole series based
off it is nothing to be sniffed at — especially

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:04.020
when it features one of the most popular members
of the Young Avengers.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:08.070
But that's not all — here are some of the
other superhero shows and movies due for release

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:09.070
in 2021:

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.300
The King's Man

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.300
Sylvester Stallone's Samaritan

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:13.720
Spider-Man 3

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.460
Batwoman season 2

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.339
Black Lightning season 4

00:12:17.339 --> 00:12:19.240
The Flash season 7

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:20.360
Stargirl season 2

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.920
The Umbrella Academy season 3

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.740
The Boys season 3

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:27.120
Lucifer season 5 part 2

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.980
Supergirl season 6

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.820
Legends of Tomorrow season 6

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.610
Titans season 3

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:33.610
and

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:34.880
Doom Patrol season 3

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:37.030
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:40.850
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
movies are coming soon.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:47.959
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

